          },
          {
            "Text": "Status of the asset. Default is ALLOWED. Can be the following enums: ALLOWED - The content is allowed to be served. BLOCKED - The content must not be served. ABANDONED - The asset was abandoned by its owner. Some possible reasons: Upload was cancelled; The application no longer needs it; The uploaded file is not of the intended type; etc.",
